{{Illusionnotes
| name = Innate
| desc = Visage's [[illusions]] bestow all {{M|talent|t=t0}} bonuses.<br><br>However, {{A|Armor|Armor Corruption}} is non-functional.
}}

 {{Innatecard}}

* {{Symbol|bonus t1l2l}}
** Visage and the {{A|Visage|Summon Familiars|text=Familiars}} have an {{M|innate}} hidden modifier that manages the hero model specific [[talent]] bonuses for them.
*** The {{ValueColor||base attack damage bonus|10tal}} {{M|talent|t=t1l}} grants the bonuses immediately to current Familiars.
*** However, it does not apply immediately to current {{M|illusions}}.
** {{A|Armor|Armor Corruption}} has the following properties:
*** Each armor reduction source applies its own {{M|debuff}}, and refreshes its own duration upon each successful attack.
*** Affects the following units:
**** {{M|Allied units|x}}.
**** {{M|Couriers}}
**** {{M|Buildings}}
**** {{M|Ward-type units}}.

