}}
{{Draftnotes
| name = Silent as the Grave
| desc = The buff only affects {{U|Familiar|text=Familiars}} and not other {{M|Summons|text=player-controlled units}}.<br><br>Grants all drafted hero models {{M|flying vision}}.
}}

 * This {{M|innate}} ability is in the {{Spellslot|5|6}}.
** {{Symbol|bonus cd}}
*** Does not reduce the ability's current cooldown value immediately upon leveling up.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** Does not interrupt Visage's {{M|channeling}} abilities upon cast.
** {{M|Disjoints}} {{M|projectiles}} upon cast only if the enemy has no {{M|True Sight}} on Visage.
** {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|visage_silent_as_the_grave}}
*** Reapplying the buff refreshes the buff duration.
*** {{Symbol|Invisible}} 
**** Grants the following ability effects immediately upon cast:
***** {{M|Flying movement}}
**** Visage can pick up or drop items without breaking [[invisibility]].
**** The invisibility breaks under the following conditions:
***** Upon its {{M|attack point}}.
***** Upon its abilities' {{M|cast point}}.
***** Upon a successful attack.

* {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|visage_silent_as_the_grave_bonus}}
** Grants the aforementioned buffs to the following units, even while {{M|invulnerable}}:
*** {{U|Familiar|text=Familiars}}
*** Visage
** {{Symbol|Attack Damage|Bonus}}
*** The [[bonus attack damage]] is granted by both of the ability's buffs.
**** Hence the successful attack that breaks the invisibility component benefits from the bonus attack damage as well.
*** Grants flat bonus attack damage corresponding to the affected unit's current {{M|main attack damage}}; values are periodically checked and the bonus values are updated immediately.
** Does not affect the following units:
*** {{M|Hidden}} units.
*** Other {{M|Summons|text=player-controlled units}}.

* {{cf|expr}}
** Ability {{M|cooldown}}: {{Code|{{#var:Silent as the Grave cd}} - ({{#var:Silent as the Grave basic1}} × SelfLvl)}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Silent as the Grave icon0}}
| desc = Visage gains flying movement and bonus movement speed.  Upon attacking or casting, the speed and flying movement are lost and Visage and his familiars deal additional attack damage for 2s.
}}
* {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|visage_silent_as_the_grave_bonus}} {{to}} {{Symbol|fx|v}}
** The {{M|bonus attack damage}} granted while {{M|invisible}} on the [[HUD]] is purely visual and does not take effect until breaking invisibility.

