{{Draftnotes
| name = Summon Familiars
| desc = Does not grant the {{A|Visage|Stone Form}} {{M|sub-ability}}.
}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Summon Familiars icon0}}
| desc = Conjures 2 blind Familiars to fight for Visage.  Familiars possess the Stone Form ability, that allows them to turn into stone, stunning enemies upon landing.  While in Stone Form, Familiars are invulnerable, and rapidly regenerate their health.  Familiars grant high bounty when killed.<br><br>The ability can be cast in the alt-cast state to recall Visages familiars after 4s, during which they cannot attack or act.
}}
* {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|visage_summon_familiars_damage_charge}}
** This modifier grants the {{U|Familiar|text=Familiars}} {{M|flying movement}}, and turns inactive whenever {{A|Visage|Stone Form}} is active.
** Hence the Familiar is a ground unit while Stone Form is active.

* Has the following formation properties:
** Visage, at point [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|21px|O]] , is always at the center of the the summoned {{U|Familiar|text=Familiars}}.
** [[File:Dota2 Visage Summon Familiars Formation icon-0.png|105px|]]
*** Creates {{#var:Summon Familiars value1}} Familiars 200-distance in front of Visage's {{M|facing angle}} at point [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|21px|P]] and point [[File:Dota2 Letter-q.png|21px|Q]].
**** {{Code|PQ {{=}} 120}} and forms a straight line.
** {{cf|talnotes}}
*** {{Symbol|bonus t4l}} [[File:Dota2 Visage Summon Familiars Formation icon-1.png|105px|]]
*** The {{ValueColor||number of Familiars increasing|25tal}} {{M|talent|t=t4l}} spawns the {{ValueColor||{{#var:Summon Familiars value1 tal}}|25tal}}<sup>rd</sup> Familiar at point [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|21px|P]], 200-distance in front of Visage.
*** The other Familiars are now placed 120-distance away from point [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|21px|P]], at point [[File:Dota2 Letter-q.png|21px|Q]], and point [[File:Dota2 Letter-s.png|21px|S]], to the left and right respectively of the Familiar in the middle.

